
@startuml
title School Facility Rental - Sequence

actor Renter
participant Website
participant "School Staff" as Staff
participant "Payment Service" as Pay
participant "Email Service" as Email

Renter -> Website: Submit rental request
Website -> Website: Check availability

note right of Website
  Requested facility is available
end note

Website -> Staff: Send request for review
Staff -> Staff: Review request

alt approved
    Staff --> Website: Approve request
    Website -> Pay: Process payment

    alt payment succeeds
        Pay --> Website: Payment succeeds
        Website -> Website: Save booking
        Website -> Email: Send confirmation email
        Email -> Renter: Booking confirmation

    else payment fails
        Pay --> Website: Payment fails
        Website -> Website: Record payment failure
        Website -> Email: Send payment failure email
        Email -> Renter: Payment failure notice
    end

else rejected
    Staff --> Website: Reject request
    Website -> Website: Record rejection
    Website -> Email: Send rejection email
    Email -> Renter: Rejection notice
end

@enduml
